{"step_index":142,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T17:23:02Z","thinking":"**Initiating GIS Map Display**\n\nI'm currently integrating Leaflet.js and CSS into `frontend/index.html` to establish interactive GIS map views. The initial focus is rendering a dynamic OpenStreetMap map within the Analytics tab. I'm exploring dark/modern and standard OSM layers for visualization, and plan to plot all relevant data points onto the map, and I'll see how it goes from there.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nWORKSPACE = Path(r'C:\\Users\\akhil\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch')\nFRONTEND = WORKSPACE / 'frontend'\nSRC = FRONTEND / 'src'\n\n# 1. Update index.html\nhtml = (FRONTEND / 'index.html').read_text(encoding='utf-8')\n\nleaflet_tags = '''  <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\\\" integrity=\\\"sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=\\\" crossorigin=\\\"\\\" />\n  <script src=\\\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\\\" integrity=\\\"sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=\\\" crossorigin=\\\"\\\"></script>\n'''\n\nif '<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/src/styles.css\\\" />' in html:\n    html = html.replace('<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/src/styles.css\\\" />', leaflet_tags + '  <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/src/styles.css\\\" />')\n\n# Add map container inside Analytics Tab\nanalytics_map_html = '''        <!-- Interactive GIS Route & Commuter Flow Map -->\n        <div class=\\\"card-box mt-4\\\">\n          <div style=\\\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\\\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>🗺️ NATPAC Interactive GIS Transit & Commuter Flow Map</h3>\n              <p class=\\\"text-muted text-sm\\\">Geographical visualization of logged survey routes, public transport corridors, and destination hubs.</p>\n            </div>\n            <button id=\\\"btn-reset-map\\\" class=\\\"btn-pill\\\">🔍 Center Kerala</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\\\"gis-map-container\\\" style=\\\"height: 380px; width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); background: #111827;\\\"></div>\n        </div>\n'''\n\nif '<div class=\\\"card-box mt-4\\\">' in html:\n    html = html.replace('<div class=\\\"card-box mt-4\\\">', analytics_map_html + '\\n        <div class=\\\"card-box mt-4\\\">', 1)\n\n(FRONTEND / 'index.html').write_text(html, encoding='utf-8')\nprint('index.html updated with Leaflet GIS Map container!')\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\akhil\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Updating index.html with Leaflet GIS map","toolSummary":"Update index.html with GIS map"}}]}
